{"4126870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Black Parallax", "steam_appid": 4126870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>What cannot be saved must be surrendered.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Our time is up. There is nothing left to gain.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>To see the world again we must first be forgotten.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The only way is through the void which looms above our souls.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">—Priestess of the Voidbound movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Parallax</strong> is a top-down timeloop mystery where a black hole eats another piece of the world every time you travel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/29e2ad52337698bc54c8011819bfaa27.webp?t=1786884027\" width=900 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the speed of light you don't experience time, while everything else does.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your destinations carefully. Every detour will cost the world years.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make mistakes, gather clues, waste your jumps, start each life with a different goal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/dea260dff89f491a676f885a58cfe354.poster.avif?t=1786884027\" width=800 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/dea260dff89f491a676f885a58cfe354.webm?t=1786884027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/dea260dff89f491a676f885a58cfe354.mp4?t=1786884027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/3f575057fb31dcab3a731dedcd328d39.webp?t=1786884027\" width=900 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manually orbit a miniature artificial star.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a pitch-black absorption nebula.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl through the ruins of a transhumanist civilization.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/c807a201a5883ff1c65d92286018845c.poster.avif?t=1786884027\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/c807a201a5883ff1c65d92286018845c.webm?t=1786884027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/c807a201a5883ff1c65d92286018845c.mp4?t=1786884027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/44c700cce7121cdf033d5b5cda4524aa.webp?t=1786884027\" width=900 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan and mimic technology the colony left behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bypass old challenges with newfound abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... just what are you, then?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/5494cdc7712335c3233022d4fa818717.poster.avif?t=1786884027\" width=798 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/5494cdc7712335c3233022d4fa818717.webm?t=1786884027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/5494cdc7712335c3233022d4fa818717.mp4?t=1786884027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/c1e981936e150f99925b9d6534c452d7.webp?t=1786884027\" width=900 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet stragglers, depressed machines, death cultists, reclusive researchers and ruthless scavengers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig for answers and help them cope with the fate of their world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out why they're still here, if there's nothing left to gain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/432be83321924e82a6ceccf3040c50da.poster.avif?t=1786884027\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/432be83321924e82a6ceccf3040c50da.webm?t=1786884027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/432be83321924e82a6ceccf3040c50da.mp4?t=1786884027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADDITIONAL INFORMATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Parallax is a finite story told in two parts. Part One is free and playable now, a standalone demo updated as development continues. Part Two completes the story in a paid release. It will not replace Part One, the free demo will remain available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As development is ongoing, any feedback is hugely appreciated. If you'd like to help improve the game, consider joining our Discord! (Linked on this page's sidebar)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>What cannot be saved must be surrendered.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Our time is up. There is nothing left to gain.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>To see the world again we must first be forgotten.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The only way is through the void which looms above our souls.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">—Priestess of the Voidbound movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Parallax</strong> is a top-down timeloop mystery where a black hole eats another piece of the world every time you travel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/29e2ad52337698bc54c8011819bfaa27.webp?t=1786884027\" width=900 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the speed of light you don't experience time, while everything else does.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your destinations carefully. Every detour will cost the world years.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make mistakes, gather clues, waste your jumps, start each life with a different goal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl