c700cce7121cdf033d5b5cda4524aa.webp?t=1786884027\" width=900 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan and mimic technology the colony left behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bypass old challenges with newfound abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... just what are you, then?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/5494cdc7712335c3233022d4fa818717.poster.avif?t=1786884027\" width=798 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/5494cdc7712335c3233022d4fa818717.webm?t=1786884027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/5494cdc7712335c3233022d4fa818717.mp4?t=1786884027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/c1e981936e150f99925b9d6534c452d7.webp?t=1786884027\" width=900 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet stragglers, depressed machines, death cultists, reclusive researchers and ruthless scavengers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig for answers and help them cope with the fate of their world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out why they're still here, if there's nothing left to gain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/extras/432be83321924e82a6ceccf3040c50da.poster.avif?t=1786884027\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite